		<Placemark>
			<name>Prince Rupert</name>
			<description>We intended to take the ferry from Prince Rupert to the top of Vancouver Island, but the ferry was sold out, so they flew us instead. We didn&apos;t want to do that - we really wanted to see the inside passage, but you have to go with the bounces.</description>
